  "narrative": "Final exploration is restricted to supplied-dataset association checks because the independent validation budget is exhausted. Direction convention remains: for a direction -1 claim, a positive signed estimate means the exposed condition has a lower, more negative outcome_001 value, i.e. stronger dependency; for a direction +1 claim, a positive signed estimate means the exposed condition has a higher numeric outcome_001 value. Threshold-scale support will require the signed 95% Welch lower bound to exceed 0.15 composite dependency-score units in the claimed direction. I activate H90-H92, which test whether the large label-cluster contrasts for feature_010, feature_002, and feature_037 persist within feature_063=1. Expected directions are feature_010 higher, feature_002 higher, and feature_037 lower, with attenuation, nullity, opposite direction, or sparse-cell failure as plausible alternatives. The first new proposal corrects the malformed H297 attempt: H297 as registered asked for a feature_027 contrast inside feature_027=1, which is self-conditioning. I instead register feature_010=1 versus feature_010=0 within feature_027=1, expecting feature_010=1 to remain a higher-score marker in line with the broader label-cluster pattern. The second new proposal tests feature_027=1 versus 0 among feature_038>=0 and feature_018<=0 without excluding feature_063, asking whether the feature_027 lower-score association persists when feature_063 is present rather than only after feature_063 exclusion. The third new proposal broadens the clean label-cluster feature_063 positive-feature_038 region from feature_018<=0 to feature_018<=0.5 to locate how far into moderate-low feature_018 the feature_063 lower-score contrast survives. Alternatives include attenuation toward zero, nullity, opposite direction, or insufficient-cell analysis failure. All proposals remain conditional supplied-dataset associations subject to opaque correlated predictors, post-hoc band selection, high multiplicity, sparse conditional cells, and possible collider-like structure from conditional restrictions. They do not support causality, mechanism, biomarker status, clinical utility, or generalizability."
